This is the Waxcode fork of xwax. Report anything about THIS fork - the control
socket, key lock, phono output, cue offsets, the ARM64 fixes, or anything else
listed in the README - at:

  https://github.com/mhallrp/waxcode-xwax

Please do not send fork issues to upstream xwax; Mark Hills maintains the
original and did not write these changes.

For upstream xwax itself, the author monitors the xwax mailing list as the
primary channel for bug reports, patches and forks:
https://xwax.org/contact.html
